 cables, this all-in-one tool tackles crimping, stripping and cutting of all RJ45 CAT5 CAT5E, CAT6 (including shielded) and RJ11/12 connectors (not AMP).</p><p>Long-lasting durability and Easy of use</p><p>Hardened Steel Contruction is durable and delivers more torque during the crimping cycle, die head assembly provides 360 degrees of connector support for terminating modular plugs on stranded or solid cable<br><br></p><h3>Specifications:</h3><ul><li>Parcel Dimensions: 26.97 x 10.39 x 3.28 cm</li><li>Weight: 517 Grams</li><li>Colour: Blue</li><li>Style: Crimp Tool</li><li>Material: Stainless Steel</li><li>Pattern: Crimp Tool</li></ul><div><br></div>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><strong></strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\"><strong>Price</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                                <tr>    \n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><a href=\"/ingco-hmpcn2468r-modular-plug-crimper\">INGCO HMPCN2468R Modular Plug Crimper</a></td>\n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\">\n                        <p class=\"price\"> \n                             \n                                <span class=\"price-new\">750৳</span> \n                    